## Use Case E — Acting employee rules

**Goal:** Prevent self-acting and derive identity fields.

**Steps:**

1. Select requester as acting → rejected.  
2. Select another employee → emp_no (and job title when set) populate read-only.

**Evidence:** `15`–`16`

