## Use Case H — Rejected rows CSV

**Goal:** Invalid rows must not create leaves; errors must be exportable.

**Examples of failures:**

| Case | Typical message |
|------|-----------------|
| Unknown emp_no | Unknown employee number |
| Empty emp_no | Missing employee number |
| Unknown kind | Unknown leave kind |
| أخرى without mapping/explanation | Configured leave type missing / needs explanation |
| End before start | Start date must be on or before end date |
| Resume ≤ end | Resume date must be after end date |
| Acting = requester | Acting employee cannot be the requester |
| Unknown acting emp_no | Unknown acting employee number |

**Evidence:** `22`–`25`, `../evidence/rejected-rows.csv`

