## Use Case I — Approve imported leave (standard workflow)

**Goal:** Use native Odoo Time Off approvals.

**Steps:**

1. Open imported leave.  
2. Confirm state (e.g. To Approve / confirm).  
3. **Approve** / **Refuse** with standard buttons.  
4. No custom “Kafaat approval engine” UI.

**Evidence:** `26`–`29`  
**Note:** Full dual-role (manager then HR) needs two users with Tim Off rights.

