## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Check |
|---------|--------|
| Import maps wrong type | Settings mapping for that kind |
| “Unknown employee” | emp_no unique and matches CSV |
| Resume validation | Must be **after** end date |
| Acting = self | Pick a different employee |
| PDF missing HR/finance | Use Leave Request Form template key; fill notes on wizard |
| Empty optional notes look wrong | Upgrade to 19.0.1.1.1; blank must not show `False` |

